{"title":"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/92841bdfe843828d61f7b38ff17b1361a965901d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0, x_1, x_2,.....x_{1994}, x_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"185\" height=\"11\" /> satisfy the relations \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae2ebb9eafe7224df2b3abca676089e790fcea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0=x_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/8/0184cd25ab1b10e36c30defc0f6f03bf96fe31ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i-1}+\\frac{2}{x_{i-1}}=2{x_i}+\\frac{1}{x_i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"181\" height=\"39\" /> \n</p><p>for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065ec358741348393366594be9e8a4cb73d9415d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1,2,3,....1995$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p>Find the maximum value that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> can have.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we start by solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/837682bc6103a4c6740c8273434e1a2c771a2514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> in the recursive relation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c33a16096b3a35733ae8fb08618fbf5054f63e61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i-1}+\\frac{2}{x_{i-1}}=2x_{i}+\\frac{1}{x_{i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"185\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a28cc96718057ed43fcca1f510fa6f02c7c36bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x_{i-1}^{2}+2}{x_{i-1}}=\\frac{2x_{i}^{2}+1}{x_{i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"157\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d96f6572a31f4731e4f5f59db2f022bafa7d446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( x_{i} \\right)\\left( x_{i-1}^{2}+2 \\right)=\\left( x_{i-1} \\right)\\left( 2x_{i}^{2}+1 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"264\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca040a95e46f5c7d4990096f08a99d4d0f4d5acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}x_{i-1}^{2}+2x_{i}=2x_{i-1}x_{i}^{2}+x_{i-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"237\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/6268fd340f6db9b43a4a4fb7770444e2ce5aad9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}x_{i-1}^{2}-2x_{i-1}x_{i}^{2}+2x_{i}-x_{i-1}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"268\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb3396845dac9c43a4059e2f108f726bf9a2be25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}x_{i-1}\\left( x_{i-1} \\right)-2x_{i}x_{i-1}\\left( x_{i} \\right)+2x_{i}-x_{i-1}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"350\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd2b655ec4a3144b25b0953d0b325ebd4503523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}x_{i-1}\\left( x_{i-1} -2x_{i}\\right)+2x_{i}-x_{i-1}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"284\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5729e9807d74bd918a04562187f84e6a645c85e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( 2x_{i}-x_{i-1}\\right)\\left( 1-x_{i}x_{i-1} \\right)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"227\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eede34241334f7138d2ced811ead490e02e841fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}=\\frac{x_{i-1}}{2},\\;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"34\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0a8d1482a11a1a3cec02a68a2093bfc146def4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}=\\frac{1}{x_{i-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"79\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>So we have two recursive properties to chose from.\n</p><p>If we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e669253c4e7faee3f83a492830f13b68c47b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> then we can use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe2009d1aad4e7271a947f7eab5ff00e6129f36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}=\\frac{x_{i-1}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"34\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50ed4b89a6aeb4814026a2be01bde8bd7d264b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79b6fb7a1d8b2bd77671950bb223396c2c43af6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1994$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.  This will make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e669253c4e7faee3f83a492830f13b68c47b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> the largest and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af72d7153500013c52a505f6879e33490f4b374f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1994}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> the smallest.\n</p><p>Then we can simply use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0a8d1482a11a1a3cec02a68a2093bfc146def4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}=\\frac{1}{x_{i-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"79\" height=\"42\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc761f619aa0e27e9eeb19ad2aa3532c087d62c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> since the reciprocal will make it very large.\n</p><p>Then we use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d637a893a16b5370b29936d049ec766cb6d14195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{0}=x_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e669253c4e7faee3f83a492830f13b68c47b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>This means that we can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/837682bc6103a4c6740c8273434e1a2c771a2514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> as:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/2/662ad328ae501f9bcf07df19bc91dff2d45c3175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{i}=\\begin{cases} \\frac{x_{0}}{2^{i}} &amp; 1 \\le i \\le 1994 \\\\ \\frac{1}{x_{i-1}} &amp; i=1995\\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"207\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b8985695fdbe65084b0ff8f165e01eb67ec4f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1994}=\\frac{x_0}{2^{1994}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"34\" />,\n</p><p>thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8f57c7898ee0a6aad29a5ae78f4eb2c296b414f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1995}=\\frac{1}{x_{1994}}=\\frac{2^{1994}}{x_0}={x_0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"212\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7b7409103d08856860f53fd6cac3d9431993f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9002e1e0e1c39feac7e793e76b94cc7c8362cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_0}^{2}=2^{1994}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1db58a7905f60b614fa5f2c96631fd1198fa1038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_0}=\\pm\\sqrt{2^{1994}}=\\pm2^{997}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"23\" />.  Since all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cad2369b5ba541ef2c49d011030698851ae39b05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> are defined as positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155332a0264540587e7a32c8522195fc29591909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_0}=2^{997}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the maximum value that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> can have is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155332a0264540587e7a32c8522195fc29591909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${x_0}=2^{997}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~ Tomas Diaz\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO\" title=\"1995 IMO\">1995 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185358\nCache expiry: 86400\n